hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"952","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd al-Sa'idi (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Uwaimir al-Ajlani Asim bin Adi al-Ansari ke paas aaya. Phir us ne us se kaha: Ae Asim! Batayo, ek shakhs apni biwi ke sath ek mard ko paye, kya wo use qatl kare to tum use qatl karoge? Ya wo kaise kare? Ae Asim! Mere liye is ke bare mein Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poochho. Phir Asim ne is ke bare mein Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poochha. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne sawalon ko na-pasand farmaya aur aib lagaya. Yahan tak ke Asim par wo bada guzra jo unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna. Phir jab Asim apne ghar walon ki taraf laute to Uwaimir aaya. Phir us ne kaha: Ae Asim! Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne tum se kya farmaya? To Asim ne kaha: Tum mere paas bhalayi lekar nahi aaye. Beshak Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us sawal ko na-pasand farmaya jo main ne Aap se poochha tha. Uwaimir ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main nahi rukunga yahan tak ke us ke bare mein poochhun. Phir Uwaimir aaya yahan tak ke logon ke darmiyan Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya. Phir us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Batayiye, ek shakhs apni biwi ke sath ek mard ko paye, kya wo use qatl kare to tum use qatl karoge? Ya wo kaise kare? To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah ne tumhare aur tumhari biwi ke bare mein nazil farmaya hai. Phir jao aur use lao. Sahl ne kaha: Phir un dono ne li'an kiya, jabke main logon ke sath Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas tha. Phir jab wo dono farigh hue to Uwaimir ne kaha: Main ne us par jhoot bola Ya Rasulullah! Agar main use rokun. Phir us ne use teen talaqein deen, Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke use hukm dene se pehle."
"953","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne li'an karne walon se farmaya: Tumhara hisab Allah par hai. Tum mein se ek jhoota hai. Tumhe us par koi raasta nahi. Us ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Mera maal? Aap ne farmaya: Tumhare liye maal nahi. Agar tum ne us par sach kaha to wo us se hai jo tum ne us ki sharmgah se halal kiya. Aur agar tum ne us par jhoot bola to wo door, tum se us se zyada door."
"954","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ek mard aur us ki biwi ke darmiyan li'an farmaya. Phir us ke bete se alag hue. Phir un dono ke darmiyan juda kar di. Aur bete ko aurat se milaya."
"955","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas li'an ka zikr hua. Phir Asim bin Adi ne is mein ek qaul kaha phir phire. Phir un ke paas un ki qaum mein se ek shakhs aaya jo un se shikayat karta tha ke us ne apni biwi ke sath ek mard ko paya hai. To Asim ne kaha: Mujhe is se aazmaya nahi gaya magar mere qaul ki wajah se. Phir wo use Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas le gaye. Phir Aap ko us se khabar di jo us ne apni biwi par paya tha. Aur wo shakhs peela, kam gosht wala, seedhe baalon wala tha. Aur wo jis par us ne dawa kiya ke us ne use apne ghar walon ke paas paya tha, bhara hua, gandum-gon, zyada gosht wala tha. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Wazeh farma. Phir wo us shakhs se mushabeh aayi jis ka us ke shohar ne zikr kiya ke us ne use paya tha. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un dono ke darmiyan li'an farmaya. Majlis mein ek shakhs ne Ibn Abbas se kaha: Kya ye wahi hai jis ke bare mein Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke agar main kisi ko baghair daleel rajm karta to ise rajm karta? To unhon ne kaha: Nahi. Wo aurat thi jo Islam mein burayi zahir karti thi."
"956","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mughira bin Shu'ba (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Sa'd bin Ubada ne kaha: Agar main apni biwi ke sath ek mard ko dekhun to use talwar se marunga baghair dab ke. Phir ye Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko pahuncha. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum Sa'd ki ghairat par ta'ajjub karte ho? Allah ki qasam! Beshak main us se zyada ghairat wala hun. Aur Allah mujh se zyada ghairat wala hai. Aur Allah ki ghairat ki wajah se fahsh kaamon ko haram farmaya, jo us mein se zahir ho aur jo chhupa ho. Aur Allah se zyada uzr ko koi pasand nahi karta. Aur is wajah se khush-khabri dene wale aur darane wale bheje. Aur Allah se zyada tareef ko koi pasand nahi karta. Aur is wajah se Allah ne Jannat ka wada farmaya."
"957","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Mere liye siyah ladka paida hua hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tumhare paas oont hain? Us ne arz kiya: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Un ke rang kya hain? Us ne arz kiya: Surkh. Aap ne farmaya: Kya un mein safed-si hai? Us ne arz kiya: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Phir ye kahan se? Us ne arz kiya: Shayad use nasl ne kheench liya. Aap ne farmaya: Shayad tumhare is bete ko nasl ne kheench liya."
